{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:40 2026-10-01 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:40 2026-10-01 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:40 2026-10-01 HKT</p><p>今日（10月1日）是國慶77周年，特區政府在早上於舉行升旗儀式，隨後有國慶酒會。</p><p>升旗儀式於上午8時在灣仔香港會議展覽中心外的金紫荊廣場舉行，社會賢達及制服團隊成員出席儀式，現場不設公眾觀禮區。行政長官李家超、全國政協副主席梁振英、中聯辦主任周霽、前行政長官林鄭月娥、曾蔭權與政府高層官員、立法會主席李慧琼等人出席升旗禮。李家超伉儷於早上7時51分到場。</p><p></p><h3>回顧2025年國慶升旗禮：</h3><img alt=\"國慶升旗儀式。盧江球攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0f1b5955eb843605073789b805a8b89f/2025-10/KakaoTalk_20251001_082743991.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8966d6cfc23303cb19c8222afed8f6cf/2025-10/KakaoTalk_20251001_082743991_01.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/53301564fb5a5b752875ae6f192b95ec/2025-10/KakaoTalk_20251001_082743991_02.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0376ed9fd5c8a72cb62f83990afb59d1/2025-10/KakaoTalk_20251001_082743991_03.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c9d716d6649ca88c29b360f987c8983/2025-10/KakaoTalk_20251001_082743991_04.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c807c986eefaf89cbd33bb919ce4aa70/2025-10/KakaoTalk_20251001_083733727_02.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3a1ed8aff0dc095bb0c4d51db0a73541/2025-10/KakaoTalk_20251001_083733727_03.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/84c3406e4bad66f8ff089454242efb22/2025-10/KakaoTalk_20251001_083733727_04.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/99c7e61f50b3e9786e77904592dff0cc/2025-10/KakaoTalk_20251001_083733727_05.jpg\"/><p>記者：郭詠欣</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T23:59:55.481507+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":281,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}